# Defiled Crypt: "Whenever one or more cards leave your graveyard, create a 2/2 black Horror enchantment creature token. This
# ability triggers only once each turn." Bot1 casts Defiled Crypt in turn 1; the Black Lotus sacrificed for it goes to the graveyard,
# which is not leaving it: no token. In turn 2 Tormod's Crypt exiles two cards from that graveyard together (the Lotus
# and itself, both gone as it resolves): one token (the cards left together, CR 603.2c). In turn 3 Bot1 unlocks Cadaver Lab, returning a
# creature card Entomb put there: the cards leave again in a new turn, a second token. A second Tormod's Crypt then exiles the
# Entomb in the same turn: the ability has triggered once this turn, so still 2 tokens.

